# =============================================================================
# Build-context exclusions (BuildKit: this file shares the Dockerfile's name and
# directory and COMPLETELY REPLACES the root .dockerignore).
# The image only needs the scripts under config/buildCMD/; after a deployment
# src/, hermes-data/ and workspace/ can hold gigabytes of sources and
# dependencies, which must never enter the build context.
# =============================================================================
src/
hermes-data/
workspace/
.env
config/.env
*.log
.git/
**/__pycache__/
